2026-10-12T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-2312) 'release tags in the V-Sekai-fire and chibifire-stages repositories, cut from 2026-10-13 on, and `scripts/check_release_tags.exs`
 # tags: rfd:scope, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2312  1 LINE
